    "Replace 2nd-order autograd.grad(..., create_graph=True) input-gradient double-backpropagation (critic_formulation='empf') with pure 1st-order Variational Multi-Scale Secant Born-Infeld critic regularization (critic_formulation='t2_secant' in particlegan/_t2_critic/penalty.py), enforcing |D(b) - D(a)| / sqrt(||b - a||_2^2 + eps^2) <= kappa directly on forward potentials with zero 2nd-order graph construction.",
    "Reuse live unscaled 1st-order D(x_real) and D(x_fake) logits from the step's adversarial forward pass at zero redundant forward cost (via instance-local _t2_critic_forward_hook with InputNoise post-perturbation coordinate tracking), paired with one detached Chebyshev-Weyl transport-chord probe concentrating micro-secants near endpoints (alpha ~ 0.004, 1 - alpha ~ 0.004) plus all-pairs Kantorovich supremum secants on low-d manifolds (d <= 1024) and O(B*d) Weyl-cyclic secants on high-dimensional images."
